     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Feb 27, 2018 at 1:09 AM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">taua...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks, Guangchuang,<div><br></div><div>This revts function helped!</div><div>I actually created a way to put the geological periods there as well =)</div><div>I will update these threads with the code once I have it finished</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Tauana</div><div><br><br>On Saturday, February 24, 2018 at 10:40:24 PM UTC-5, Yu, Guangchuang wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">On Sun, Feb 25, 2018 at 6:51 AM,  &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">taua...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p><div><p></p><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi!<div><br></div><div>I have another thread about geological timescale, but I have more specific questions here.</div><div><br></div><div>I have a calibrated tree going back to ~400 million years ago. I have tried to use the mrsd argument to plot the timescale below the tree, but nothing happens. All the examples I found are for modern data, e.g. since 1990s or similar. How can I plot such old ages? Also couldn&#39;t find more info about how to use msrd in the manual, so would really appreciate a suggestion.</div><div><br></div></div></blockquote><p></p></div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">The <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">mrsd</code> parameter is indeed design for modern data. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">For your issue, you can just plot the tree like other ordinary tree. Don’t confuse with time or substitution rate scale. Technically, they are the same and are all numeric values along the x-axis. Maybe what you want is just <a href=\"https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/ggtree/issues/87\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/ggtree/issues/87&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482598856000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UcTLVOKO0rl8ZYoESod-i\">https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/ggtree/issues/87</a>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p><div><p></p><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div></div><div>Also, I managed to plot the age ranges with geom_range. When I open the function, it shows me the option of plotting the ages with plot_age which I suppose could plot the &quot;height_median&quot; information on the nodes. However, when I run it with this parameter, R says &quot;Ignoring unknown parameters: plot_age&quot;. Also couldn&#39;t find it in the manual. What would be the best way to plot a text or numerical attribute on the nodes?</div><div><br></div></div></blockquote><p></p></div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">There is indeed no <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">plot_age</code> parameter. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p></span><div><p></p><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><span><div dir=\"ltr\"><div></div><div>Thank you in advance,</div><div>Tauana</div></div></span><span><font color=\"#888888\"><span>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nG Yu, DK Smith, H Zhu, Y Guan, TTY Lam*. ggtree: an R package for visualization and annotation of phylogenetic trees with their covariates and other associated data, Methods in Ecology and Evolution, 2017, 8(1):28-36. doi:10.1111/2041-210X.12628<br>\r\n <br>\r\nHomepage: <a href=\"https://guangchuangyu.github.io/ggtree\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://guangchuangyu.github.io/ggtree&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482598856000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EqZWntVEaXch-jjQQIBv7\">https://guangchuangyu.github.io/ggtree</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggtree&quot; group.<br></span>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">bioc-ggtree...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">bioc-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<span><br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/bioc-ggtree/8059beb6-d711-4289-80b9-2ef3f4d74db2%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/bioc-ggtree/8059beb6-d711-4289-80b9-2ef3f4d74db2%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482598856000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0SIFQL3gMN4SDbUnk9Lhvj\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/bioc-ggtree/8059beb6-d711-4289-80b9-2ef3f4d74db2%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482598856000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zqkfXb9297mgyGFkZ81vI\">https://group